{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"J'aimerais que mes tranches de visage soient remplies de ces 6 [i]tartes[/i] au lieu de vos noms"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"Classic American pie for a classic non-nation-affiliated wheel."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Tasty, tangy, and oozing red on the inside, just like me."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"You gotta roll yourself down to Georgia for THIS treat."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"This pie's a real jack-o-lantern of all trades."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"Tart with a graham cracker crust, THIS pie puts me in the island mood."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"Balance out the sour with a little bit of whipped, hard-to-bake sweet. Pucker up!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"Don't be offended, your names are great. I just have a sweet tooth."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio","s":"Honestly, if I ate all that crap, I'd be so bloated your names would be a larger font size."}]}
